flowchart TB
  UI[React role-aware browser] --> API[Express REST API]
  API --> AUTH[JWT sessions and RBAC]
  API --> OPS[Care operations]
  OPS --> TX[Atomic incident + audit + outbox transaction]
  TX --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  DB --> WORKER[Durable anchoring worker]
  WORKER --> REG[ChainMedAuditRegistry]
  API --> VERIFY[Integrity verification engine]
  VERIFY --> REG
  VERIFY --> DB
  VERIFY --> FEEDBACK[Findings and notifications]
  FEEDBACK --> UI
